{"id":"e9b22aa29a071172","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-no-countable-lub.md","title":"严格上升序列没有最小上界","display":"cor-no-countable-lub — 严格上升序列没有最小上界","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-no-countable-lub","aliases":["20-cor-no-countable-lub"],"display":"cor-no-countable-lub — 严格上升序列没有最小上界","chapter":"6","section":"6.5","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Corollary 6.5.4","source_pdf_pages":[176],"source_printed_pages":[142],"depends_on":["[[20-thm-exact-pair]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-no-countable-lub"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-no-countable-lub</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-no-countable-lub — 严格上升序列没有最小上界"},{"key":"chapter","html":"6"},{"key":"section","html":"6.5"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 6.5.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>176</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>142</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f1ca4420af66074c\" href=\"?note=f1ca4420af66074c\" title=\"20-thm-exact-pair\">20-thm-exact-pair</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf b_0&lt;\\mathbf b_1&lt;\\cdots\">\\(\\mathbf b_0&lt;\\mathbf b_1&lt;\\cdots\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f1ca4420af66074c\" href=\"?note=f1ca4420af66074c\" title=\"20-thm-exact-pair\">20-thm-exact-pair</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}no\\text{-}countable\\text{-}lub}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[(\\forall n\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf c)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\ ((\\forall n\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf d)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf d)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}no\\text{-}countable\\text{-}lub}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[(\\forall n\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf c)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\ ((\\forall n\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf d)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf d)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若存在最小上界 c，它在精确对两边之下，因而在某个 b_n 下；但 c 又在 b_(n+1) 上，矛盾。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 6.5.4；印刷页 142；PDF 第 176 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-thm-exact-pair","status":"resolved","id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-exact-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-exact-pair","status":"resolved","id":"f1ca4420af66074c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-exact-pair]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf b_0<\\mathbf b_1<\\cdots","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}no\\text{-}countable\\text{-}lub}\\vdash\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal D\\\n[(\\forall n\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf c)\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\ ((\\forall n\\ \\mathbf b_n\\le\\mathbf d)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf d)].","display":true}],"bytes":1112,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f1ca4420af66074c"]}